<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <title>Contact Me | Kate Caruso ePortfolio</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css?family=Oxygen:400,700,300" rel="stylesheet">
    <link href="style.css" rel="stylesheet" media="screen">
    <style>
        .contact-page #wrapper,
        .contact-page .container {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            max-width: 100%;
        }

        .contact-page #logo {
            padding-block: 2rem 1rem;
        }

        .contact-page #page {
            width: min(100%, 66rem);
            padding: 0 clamp(1rem, 4vw, 2rem) 2.5rem;
        }

        .contact-details {
            margin-top: 2rem;
            padding-top: 1.5rem;
            border-top: 1px solid;
            border-top-color: color-mix(in srgb, currentColor 22%, transparent);
        }

        .contact-details h2 {
            margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
        }

        .contact-details a {
            overflow-wrap: anywhere;
        }

        @media (max-width: 75rem) {
            .contact-page #menu {
                height: auto;
            }

            .contact-page #menu ul {
                display: flex;
                flex-wrap: wrap;
                justify-content: center;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="contact-page">
<div id="wrapper">
    <div id="menu-wrapper">
        <nav id="menu" class="container" aria-label="Portfolio">
            <ul>
                <li><a href="index.html">About</a></li>
                <li><a href="image.html">Image Editing</a></li>
                <li><a href="web.html">Web Design</a></li>
                <li><a href="video.html">Video Production</a></li>
                <li><a href="animation.html">Animation</a></li>
                <li><a href="screencast.html">Screencast</a></li>
                <li class="current_page_item"><a href="contact.html" aria-current="page">Contact Me</a></li>
            </ul>
        </nav>
    </div>

    <div id="logo" class="container">
        <h1>Contact Me</h1>
    </div>

    <main id="page" class="container">
        <div class="entry">
            <p>Thank you for visiting my ePortfolio. If you have a question about one of my projects or would like to share feedback, I’d be happy to hear from you.</p>
        </div>

        <section class="contact-details" aria-labelledby="email-heading">
            <h2 id="email-heading">Email</h2>
            <p><a href="mailto:katharinecaruso@ufl.edu">KatharineCaruso@ufl.edu</a></p>
        </section>
    </main>
</div>

<div id="footer">
    <p>© 2026 Kate Caruso | EME 6208 DIME |
        <a href="https://education.ufl.edu/educational-technology/">UF Educational Technology</a> |
        Template adapted from <a href="https://templated.co">TEMPLATED</a>
    </p>
</div>
</body>
</html>
